                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-21T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>416. Your 880, December 15, 4 p.m. Your reply to Cunningham as quoted is
                    approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
